    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to learn a new language?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your linguistic prowess with <strong>Speechbound</strong>, a <i>multi platform language learning RPG</i> where the thrill of gaming and the power of education converge!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/a50069a7cf3063015cb6cb6acfaba74f.avif?t=1752882124\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero</strong> is going to have to explore this strange new land, and learn the language of its people in order to help rebuild the moon\u2019s community, get them out from under the rule of the oppressive <strong>SunCorp\u2122</strong>, and save the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/998958a21caed7f325d9fa6c9eac37c2.webp?t=1752882124\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/4827878751c0b52da9a6511b7f317c09.avif?t=1752882124\" /></span>Recover stolen language and use it to talk to NPCs, discover secrets, engage in conversations, and immerse yourself a rich storyline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/5e2d90a6490d94edf81d968735fe9b4c.poster.avif?t=1752882124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/5e2d90a6490d94edf81d968735fe9b4c.webm?t=1752882124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sha