ph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/ec8017cdad92d84b4f18fe3d608bc6e1.poster.avif?t=1752882124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/ec8017cdad92d84b4f18fe3d608bc6e1.webm?t=1752882124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/ec8017cdad92d84b4f18fe3d608bc6e1.mp4?t=1752882124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/998958a21caed7f325d9fa6c9eac37c2.webp?t=1752882124\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/7ccabeaa69d3adb54e30d9218afcc1eb.avif?t=1752882124\" /></span>Battle an ominous alien threat, help rebuild the station, heal the environment, and restore peace to a diverse community of characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/57f5c35efb0e969305e4e75b4e6818c0.poster.avif?t=1752882124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/57f5c35efb0e969305e4e75b4e6818c0.webm?t=1752882124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/57f5c35efb0e969305e4e75b4e6818c0.mp4?t=1752882124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/998958a21caed7f325d9fa6c9eac37c2.webp?t=1752882124\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/45ab8cb82bd11420b5cced0df72cab4d.avif?t=1752882124\" /></span>Gather ingredients and practice vocabulary as you craft delicious meals to help you survive the dangers of exploration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/792fa0b19b180caffac3aad506825119.poster.avif?t=1752882124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/792fa0b19b180caffac3aad506825119.webm?t=1752882124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/792fa0b19b180caffac3aad506825119.mp4?t=1752882124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/998958a21caed7f325d9fa6c9eac37c2.webp?t=1752882124\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/131d93356e9abd3d5bf8b7b859a4cfbe.avif?t=1752882124\" /></span>Visit the school to sharpen your grammar skills, learn about sentence structures, specific rules and exceptions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/e7aa3cf99f052e649faecc97835bee31.poster.avif?t=1752882124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/e7aa3cf99f052e649faecc97835bee31.webm?t=1752882124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/e7aa3cf99f052e649faecc97835bee31.mp4?t=1752882124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/998958a21caed7f325d9fa6c9eac37c2.webp?t=1752882124\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a captivating narrative, interact with diverse characters, battle formidable foes, tackle exciting language exercises, and discover the beautifully hand-crafted world of <i><strong>Babyl Moon</strong></i>. At <strong>Moonspire Games</strong>, our mission is to transform the way you learn languages - making it immersive, engaging, and above all, unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your support we're planning on integrating the following languages:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>English, Chinese, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, French, Italian</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist! </strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to learn a new language?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your linguistic prowess with <strong>Speechbound</strong>, a <i>multi platform language learning RPG</i> where the thrill of gaming and the power of education converge!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/a50069a7cf3063015cb6cb6acfaba74f.avif?t=1752882124\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero</strong> is going to have to explore this strange new land, and learn the language of its people in order to help rebuild the moon\u2019s community, get them out from under the rule of the oppressive <strong>SunCorp\u2122</strong>, and save the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/998958a21caed7f325d9fa6c9eac37c2.webp?t=1752882124\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/4827878751c0b52da9a6511b7f317c09.avif?t=1752882124\" /></span>Recover stolen language and use it to talk to NPCs, discover secrets, engage in conversations, and immerse yourself a rich storyline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/5e2d90a6490d94edf81d968735fe9b4c.poster.avif?t=1752882124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521500/extras/5e2d90a6490d94edf81d968735fe9b4c.webm?t=1752882124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.ak